      "invariants_checked": [
        "ReAct loop enforces maxIterations, round cancellation checks before and after tool dispatch, UTF-8 safe tool output truncation, and natural-stop continuation draftBoundary placement prior to newly injected background or user messages.",
        "HITL suspend/resume snapshots persist and replay pending tool calls, answered/remaining calls, BackgroundInjected completions, and prior AgentSteps, while ensuring collaboration parent leases (EndParentRun) are always released even on early Resume validation errors.",
        "Streaming and background agent runs propagate caller context cancellation cleanly without marking canceled runs IsComplete, recover tool panics without crashing the process, and isolate session/tenant execution contexts under -race.",
        "Builtin assistant prompts, headers, and event payloads align with GENYEE branding with zero unexcused legacy brand residues."
      ],
      "findings": [
        {
          "id": "W5-AGENT-001",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/agent/resume.go:108-186, internal/agent/suspend.go:95-145",
          "summary": "Resume dropped snap.BackgroundInjected messages when reconstructing the LLM transcript and omitted snap.Steps when initializing state.AgentSteps, losing completed background subagent/shell notifications and pre-suspension reasoning/tool history across HITL suspend/resume.",
          "regression_test": "TestResumeReplaysBackgroundInjectionsAndDisplaySteps",
          "commit": "94e890230c2ecc594460bb35937ff496be463407"
        },
        {
          "id": "W5-AGENT-002",
          "severity": "P1",
          "file": "internal/agent/engine.go:635-720, internal/agent/act.go:210-265, internal/agent/resume.go:70-125",
          "summary": "executeLoop marked state.IsComplete = true when context cancellation raced with a round boundary, tryContinueAfterNaturalStop recorded draftBoundary after appending newly injected background/user input (causing continuation suppression or mis-scoping), and early errors in Resume leaked collaborationParent.EndParentRun leases.",
          "regression_test": "TestExecuteLoopCancelAtRoundBoundaryLeavesIsCompleteFalse, TestNaturalStopContinuationPlacesDraftBoundaryBeforeInjectedInput, TestResumeEarlyErrorEndsCollaborationParentLease",
          "commit": "94e890230c2ecc594460bb35937ff496be463407"
        }
